            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "compression": 1795,
            "text": "{\"markdown\":\"How CORE-1 is proved.\\n\\n:::check{#c-routes serves=\\\"dispatch://CORE-1/artifact/requirements-md#b-r1\\\" surface=\\\"cli\\\" run=\\\"bun test e2e/__tests__/review-routes.test.ts\\\" when=\\\"before_merge\\\" negative_control=\\\"Drop a row and the test names the route it no longer covers.\\\"}\\nEvery route of the router is reviewed or excluded.\\n:::\\n\\n:::check{#c-ready serves=\\\"dispatch://CORE-1/artifact/requirements-md#b-r2\\\" surface=\\\"browser\\\" run=\\\"bunx playwright test --config e2e/playwright.config.ts\\\" when=\\\"before_merge\\\" negative_control=\\\"Point a row at a skeleton and the run times out on it.\\\"}\\nEach page is read once it is drawn.\\n:::\\n\\n:::check{#c-long-path serves=\\\"dispatch://CORE-1/artifact/requirements-md#b-r2\\\" surface=\\\"cli\\\" run=\\\"bash packages/dispatch/e2e/acceptance/converted-verification-check-with-a-long-path.sh\\\" when=\\\"before_merge\\\" negative_control=\\\"Point it at a skeleton and it fails.\\\"}\\nBefore READY, against production, bash packages/dispatch/e2e/acceptance/converted-verification-check-with-a-long-path.sh\\n:::\\n\",\"markdown_tree\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"How CORE-1 is proved.\"}]},{\"type\":\"check\",\"attrs\":{\"blockId\":\"c-routes\",\"negative_control\":\"Drop a row and the test names the route it no longer covers.\",\"run\":\"bun test e2e/__tests__/review-routes.test.ts\",\"serves\":[\"dispatch://CORE-1/artifact/requirements-md#b-r1\"],\"surface\":\"cli\",\"when\":\"before_merge\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Every route of the router is reviewed or excluded.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"check\",\"attrs\":{\"blockId\":\"c-ready\",\"negative_control\":\"Point a row at a skeleton and the run times out on it.\",\"run\":\"bunx playwright test --config e2e/playwright.config.ts\",\"serves\":[\"dispatch://CORE-1/artifact/requirements-md#b-r2\"],\"surface\":\"browser\",\"when\":\"before_merge\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Each page is read once it is drawn.\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"check\",\"attrs\":{\"blockId\":\"c-long-path\",\"negative_control\":\"Point it at a skeleton and it fails.\",\"run\":\"bash packages/dispatch/e2e/acceptance/converted-verification-check-with-a-long-path.sh\",\"serves\":[\"dispatch://CORE-1/artifact/requirements-md#b-r2\"],\"surface\":\"cli\",\"when\":\"before_merge\"},\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Before READY, against production, bash packages/dispatch/e2e/acceptance/converted-verification-check-with-a-long-path.sh\"}]}]}]},\"token\":\"sha256:cef25d2a88e123f814b07bff1c5408aabdfb9d94977b9b4cae63b17181dddcac\",\"version\":2}\n"
